\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Layer selected by each metric (layer number and relative depth). The \texttt  {bal\_acc $\times $ crossing\_rate} metric selects shallow layers for all models, while three threshold-dependent metrics converge on deep layers at 32B. Pure \texttt  {bal\_acc} selects middle layers. LOO-CV stability: the dominant layer is selected in 65--68\% of folds.}}{4}{table.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
