\newlabel{tab:w-ablation}{{5}{6}{HS probe precision across window sizes at corrected layers. Precision increases monotonically for R1-8B and QwQ-32B. OT-7B peaks at $W=3$ and declines (early saturation). Different optimal $W$ per model is a genuine characteristic, not cherry-picking}{table.caption.17}{}}
