\newlabel{tab:safe-fpr}{{6}{6}{Safe-trace false positive rates across all models and methods. Only OT-7B HS static (11.1\%) meets a practical $<$20\% FPR threshold. HS achieves lower FPR than text for 3/4 models (exception: QwQ, where text static is lower)}{table.caption.18}{}}
